@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay (Health Check) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach toan bo san pham -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. Lay chi tiet san pham ton tai -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. Lay chi tiet san pham khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. Tham so route sai kieu du lieu (:int) -> 404 Not Found (Framework)
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao san pham hop le -> 201 Created + Header Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### 7. Tao san pham sai quy tac nghiep vu (ten rong, gia am) -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Khong co ten va gia am",
  "price": -10000
}

### 8. Gui yeu cau POST thieu header Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/products

{
  "name": "Thieu Header",
  "price": 50000
}

### 9. Gui payload JSON sai cu phap (Malformed JSON) -> 400 Bad Request (Framework)
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Loi JSON",
  "price": 

### 10. Goi sai phuong thuc HTTP tren endpoint ton tai -> 405 Method Not Allowed (Framework)
PUT {{api}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Khong co PUT"
}
